      "note": "A review with repository, master and leaf supplies a memoized explainer address plus planned/live-or-recorded and comparison-number context; a review without all three keeps the document chat. The leaf's stage comes from the exact shared task entry. The matching first-request event opens the existing column but starts nothing, and task hydration/missing-task states still prevent accidental Projects Architect binding. The default review recipient is the explainer or its placeholder; the Worker is never selected by default.\n\nAnchor: `useReviewChatTask`, `useReviewChat`, `explainerAddress`, `useExplainerTargetOf`, `useFirstRequestOpens`",
